        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Don 2 (soundtrack)\n- People: Priyanka Chopra, Shankar-Ehsaan-Loy, Farhan Akhtar, Shahrukh Khan, Boman Irani, Om Puri, Lara Dutta, Kunal Kapoor\n- Organizations: Government of India, Time magazine\n- Awards: Padma Shri, Time 100\n\nFacts:\n- Don 2 is a soundtrack album composed by the trio Shankar-Ehsaan-Loy for the film Don 2.\n- The film Don 2 was directed by Farhan Akhtar and starred Shahrukh Khan, Priyanka Chopra, Boman Irani, Om Puri, Lara Dutta, and Kunal Kapoor.\n- In 2016, the Government of India honoured Priyanka Chopra with the Padma Shri, India's fourth-highest civilian award.\n- In 2016, Time magazine named Priyanka Chopra one of the 100 most influential people in the world.",
